Now let me check one more thing about whether the empty details fast path actually short-circuits ALL renderer paths. Let me re-check.

Looking at the code path:

```
renderResult(result, { expanded }, theme, _context) {
    const details = result.details as SubagentDetails | SuspendedSnapshot | undefined;
    if (
        !details ||
