```

The condition is `details.results.length === 0 && details.suspensions?.length === 0`. This is correct for `handleTranscript` which passes `_makeDetails(picked.entry.mode)([])` — `results` is empty array, `suspensions` is empty by default (per `makeDetails` factory).

This early-return path:
1. Doesn't iterate normal-mode (single/parallel/chain) branches
2. Doesn't iterate suspension branches  
3. Doesn't iterate display items / format tool calls

So both `expanded: true` and `expanded: false` collapse to the same fast path. The TUI never has to walk hundreds of messages. ✓

