This sets the module-level `modelsStore` to `undefined`. The check `loadModelsStore()` is:
```typescript
function loadModelsStore(): Record<string, ...> | null {
    if (modelsStore !== undefined) return modelsStore ?? null;
    try {
        const raw = fs.readFileSync(...);
        ...
    } catch {
        modelsStore = null;
